<title>POLAND: ZASADA TO ISSUE PLN 0.5 MLN, 5.2 MLN CPS.</title>
<headline>ZASADA TO ISSUE PLN 0.5 MLN, 5.2 MLN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish automotive group Sobieslaw Zasada Centrum SA wants to issue on Thursday 500,000 zlotys worth commercial papers and 5.2 million zlotys worth CPs on Friday, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said both papers matured in three months.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
